		"description": "<p>With a sharp gesture of your hand, you reach out toward a nearby foe and are briefly linked by lightning that leaps outward, then violently draws them in. Target an enemy within 15ft and make a melee weapon attack as part of the attack action, replacing one of your attacks. On a successful hit you deal Basic Melee lightning damage and the target must then make a Strength saving throw or be pulled up to 10ft closer to you.</p>",
